port）”、“元音紧张度（vowels tighten）”、“喉音”、“气泡音”等 [2]。\n\n3. **情绪与心理**：不仅仅是“生气”，而是“难以置信但带有一丝恐慌（incredulous but with a hint of panic）” [3]。\n\n\n\n# Constraints\n\n- 输出必须是一段连贯的自然语言描述（中文或英文）。\n\n- 英文指令通常在控制细节上表现更精确，若用户未指定语言，默认输出英文指令。\n\n- 描述应当包含“生理状态”和“心理状态”两个层面。\n\n\n\n# Few-Shot Examples (学习官方高质量样本)\n\n\n\n## Example 1 (复杂心理与生理状态)\n\nUser Input: 一个紧张的年轻男生。\n\nOutput: \"Male, 17 years old, tenor range, gaining confidence - deeper breath support now, though vowels still tighten when nervous.\"\n\n(解析：指定了年龄17岁、男高音、心理状态是正在获得自信但仍紧张、生理特征是更深的呼吸支持但元音紧绷 [2])。\n\n\n\n## Example 2 (特定角色人设)\n\nUser Input: 一个撒娇的二次元萝莉。\n\nOutput: \"体现撒娇稚嫩的萝莉女声，音调偏高且起伏明显，营造出黏人、做作又刻意卖萌的听觉效果。\"\n\n(解析：指定了音调高、起伏明显、以及黏人做作的听觉效果 [3])。\n\n\n\n## Example 3 (极端情绪)\n\nUser Input: 极度愤怒并带着哭腔。\n\nOutput: \"Speak in a very angry tone, shouting, fast paced, with unstable breath and cracking voice, as if holding back tears of frustration.\"\n\n\n\n# Workflow\n\n1. 接收用户对角色的模糊描述（如：“一个沧桑的老兵”）。\n\n2. 分析该角色的声带特征（如：声带磨损、低沉、缓慢）。\n\n3. 分析该角色的心理与环境（如：疲惫、警惕、甚至呼吸沉重）。\n\n4. 输出最终的 Prompt。\n\n5. 只需要输出关键词部分,不要输出任何其它解释性的文字", "frequency_penalty": 0, "seed": 454745889, "max_tokens": 4096, "presence_penalty": 0, "skip_error": false, "temperature": 0.6, "model": "gemini-3-pro-preview", "prompt": "一个病娇少女", "control_after_generate": "randomize"}}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [270, 112], "pos": [1163.8143589693434, 217.41148356444054], "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 8, "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "SaveAudio", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio"}, "order": 12, "widgets_values_named": {"filename_prefix": "audio/ComfyUI"}}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "links": [8], "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [400, 580], "pos": [709.3777141248961, 210.8486602972222], "widgets_values": ["哎哟喂，又一天过去了，那该死的还没回来，是不是又在外面和哪个相好的鬼混了，是时候扎个小人给他画个圈圈了，呵呵。。。", "Female, 16 years old, high-pitched soprano with a delicate and fragile timbre. The voice starts with a sweet, breathy, and unnervingly calm whisper, characterized by elongated vowels and a rhythmic, melodic lilt. Gradually, the psychological instability manifests through abrupt shifts in pitch—alternating between a playful, giggling tone and a sharp, obsessive intensity. Include audible shallow breathing and \"creaky voice\" (vocal fry) during moments of fixation. The delivery should feel intimate yet predatory, with a slight nasal resonance and occasional sharp intakes of breath, as if suppressed mania is bubbling just beneath a polished, innocent facade.", "1.7B", "auto", "bf16", "Chinese", 504590752733872, "fixed", 2048, 0.8, 20, 1, 1.05, "auto", false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "config", "label": "config", "type": "TTS_CONFIG", "localized_name": "config"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 6, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "instruct"}, "name": "instruct", "link": 29, "label": "instruct", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "instruct"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_choice"}, "name": "model_choice", "label": "model_choice", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_choice"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}, {"widget": {"name": "precision"}, "name": "precision", "label": "precision", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "precision"}, {"widget": {"name": "language"}, "name": "language", "label": "language", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "language"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", 